## <%if .DisplayName%><%.DisplayName%><%else%><%.Slug%><%end%> — shape: a multi-file bundle.
##
## main.bot keeps the graph only. The prompts live in prompts/*.md and
## are merged into the workflow by their file stem at every launch
## (prompts/mission.md → `system: mission`, prompts/kickoff.md →
## `user: kickoff`); a prompt declared here would win over a file of
## the same name. skills/house-style.md is mirrored into the run's
## .claude/skills/ for the agent to read. Fill in: the mission (in
## prompts/mission.md), the house style. docs/bundles.md
<%template "vars_block" .%>
schema report:
  summary: string
  mission_complete: bool

agent campaign:<%template "llm_fields" .%>
  ## Both prompts come from prompts/*.md — nothing declares them here.
  system: mission
  user: kickoff
  output: report

workflow <%.WorkflowName%>:
  entry: campaign<%template "worktree_dial" .%><%template "dials" .%><%template "budget_block" .%>
  campaign -> done
